        "id": "VelkozPassive",
        "name": "Organic Deconstruction",
        "summary": "Vel'Koz's abilities apply <keywordName>Organic Deconstruction</keywordName> to enemies on hit. If 3 stacks are accumulated, the enemy will take a burst of true damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Vel'Koz's Abilities apply a stack of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Deconstruction</span> for 7 seconds. Enemies with 3 stacks consume them and take <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(60% Ability Power) true damage</span>.<br /><br />Vel'Koz's Attacks refresh the duration of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Deconstruction</span>, but won't add new stacks.",
